WEBVTT

10:31.657 --> 10:34.493
A good king knows
when to save his strength...

10:36.120 --> 10:38.497
and when to destroy his enemies.

10:39.749 --> 10:41.209
So you agree...

10:42.084 --> 10:43.586
the Starks are enemies?

10:46.088 --> 10:49.425
Everyone who isn't us...
is an enemy.

10:52.887 --> 10:55.181
Enough of that, young lady.
Eat your food.

10:55.306 --> 10:57.266
- I'm practicing.
- Practicing for what?

10:57.391 --> 10:59.310
- The prince.
- Arya, stop!

10:59.435 --> 11:02.563
He's a liar and a coward
and he killed my friend.
